<item><title>Senegal arrests former bodyguard over CFA235 million plot fraud</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/senegal-arrests-former-bodyguard-over-cfa235-million-plot-11178d/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/senegal-arrests-former-bodyguard-over-cfa235-million-plot-11178d/</guid><category>Senegal</category><description>Investigators in Dakar say a colonel and several acquaintances paid deposits for residential land whose allocation certificates now appear to be fictitious.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 08:58:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sn.jpg" length="32606" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sn.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Keur Massar investigators arrest six more men in HIV-transmission inquiry</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/keur-massar-investigators-arrest-six-more-men-in-hiv-0f955a/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/keur-massar-investigators-arrest-six-more-men-in-hiv-0f955a/</guid><category>Senegal</category><description>The men were detained on 17 and 18 November after contacts on two suspects’ phones led gendarmes to new people in the case.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 08:24:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sn.jpg" length="32606" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sn.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
