<item><title>Senegal continues search for dozens missing after migrant boat capsizes</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/senegal-continues-search-for-dozens-missing-after-migrant-ef985f/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/senegal-continues-search-for-dozens-missing-after-migrant-ef985f/</guid><category>Senegal</category><description>Four bodies have reportedly been recovered, while a survivor told police about 100 people were aboard the boat off Yenne.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 15:52:26 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sn.jpg" length="32606" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sn.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Faye enacts Senegal&apos;s rejected 2026 revised budget by decree</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/faye-enacts-senegal-s-rejected-2026-revised-budget-by-decree-70c8c6/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/faye-enacts-senegal-s-rejected-2026-revised-budget-by-decree-70c8c6/</guid><category>Senegal</category><description>The president acted after Pastef, which holds a large majority in parliament, rejected the revised budget and the 2027 budget.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 09:45:26 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/faye-enacts-senegal-s-rejected-2026-revised-budget-by-decree-70c8c6/share.jpg" length="41748" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/faye-enacts-senegal-s-rejected-2026-revised-budget-by-decree-70c8c6/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
